2:T4dd,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice","headline":"Natural Instincts — Attenborough","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.webp"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Find out more about the Natural Instincts game trailer and Guy Harris, the voiceover artist responsible for the David Attenborough voice featured in the trailer","datePublished":"2021-07-10T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2021-07-10T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["gaming parody“nature"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice.jpg"}}4:T455,<h2>My Attenborough Voice Gets Back to Nature</h2>
<p>Anyone who’s spent more than 30 seconds on my site knows I’ve a rather popular <a href="/david-attenborough-voice" title="David Attenborough Voiceover">David Attenborough impression</a>. From <a href="/horizon-zero-dawn-voice" title="Attenborough Voice Horizon Game">epic game trailers like Horizon Zero Dawn</a> to viral <a href="/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice" title="Turkish Airlines Attenborough Voice">airline parodies</a>, I get asked to voice all sorts of wild and wonderful scripts in the style of Sir David.</p>

<p>So, when the opportunity came up to lend that voice to a nature simulation game, <strong>Natural Instincts</strong>, it felt like a match made in gaming heaven. The concept was spot on – a nature documentary simulation, teaching players how to protect animals and ecosystems.</p>

<p>If you’d like to experiment with your own scripts, you can try out the free <a href="/attenborough-script-generator" title="David Attenborough Voice Generator">Attenborough Voice Generator</a> and see how your idea might sound!</p>7:["slug","natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice","d"]
