GB\",\"uploadDate\":\"2021-07-10T00:00:00+00:00\",\"description\":\"Find out more about the Natural Instincts game trailer and Guy Harris, the voiceover artist responsible for the David Attenborough voice featured in the trailer\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Natural Instincts — Attenborough"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A pretty perfect use for my tried-and-tested David Attenborough voice.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/barclaycard-fraud-fighter-tool-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Barclaycard Fraud Fighter Tool ","aria-label":"Previous: Barclaycard Fraud Fighter Tool ","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Scream Ghost Face Voiceover","aria-label":"Next: Scream Ghost Face Voiceover","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$4"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yshYPy13QUQ","title":"Natural Instincts — Attenborough","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice.jpg","alt":"natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Natural Instincts — Attenborough"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>About Natural Instincts</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Natural Instincts</strong> is an interactive nature sim game that began life on Kickstarter. The premise: protect the environment, guide animal behaviour, and learn how ecosystems thrive – all delivered in a relaxing gameplay loop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It’s educational, it’s beautifully animated, and it was an ideal excuse to go full-Attenborough. Whether narrating a baby badger’s struggle or a squirrel’s foraging frenzy, the project made full use of my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice Style\">signature documentary tone</a>.</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Would you like to work with me?</h2>\r\n<p>Thanks for reading all the way down here – there’s a good chance you're looking for an experienced British male voiceover artist. Whether you're working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Explainer Video Voice\">explainer</a>, or a <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">game trailer</a>, I'd be happy to take a look at your script.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And if it’s the style of <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Sound-Alike\">Sir David Attenborough</a> you're after, rest assured: it’ll be delivered with polish, respect, and just the right touch of wildlife wonder.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/attenborough-voice-og.webp","alt":"natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Looking for a Natural Narrator?</h2>\r\n<p>If you’re working on a nature-based commercial, explainer, documentary, or game – and fancy giving it the Attenborough-style treatment – I’d be happy to help. Whether you’ve got a script ready or just a rough idea, drop me a line via the <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">contact form</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need more examples? Explore my other Attenborough projects:  \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/horizon-zero-dawn-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Game Trailer\">Horizon Zero Dawn Trailer</a></li>  \r\n<li><a href=\"/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Turkish Airlines Attenborough Voice\">Turkish Airlines ‘Bird’ Spoof</a></li>  \r\n<li><a href=\"/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"David Attenborough Script Generator\">Attenborough Voice Generator</a></li>  \r\n</ul></p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Natural Instincts — Attenborough","pageUrl":"natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","610",{"href":"/my-corporate-video-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/my-corporate-video-voice-over.jpg","alt":"My Corporate Video voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"My Corporate Video voic